op&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c50501b1d44ec4d641ebf86a5c46940", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b9cb723/uploads/origins/d1469f6f-cbc0-4959-967e-e6a94e005ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c50501b1d44ec4d641ebf86a5c46940, https://si.imgix.net/6b9cb723/uploads/origins/d1469f6f-cbc0-4959-967e-e6a94e005ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f4afd44623662759ebc8659e51576b2c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b9cb723/uploads/origins/d1469f6f-cbc0-4959-967e-e6a94e005ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=562bc33f439a77238c36a53bbbd22312 3x"}, "body": "初めまして～\nあなたの素敵なイラストはとても好きです。\nあなたのスタイルで私のＯＣを描いてほしいです！\n\n【キャラクター】(空來Akira)\n身長186cm、やや褐色肌、引き締まっている筋肉質タイプ、\n人間と狼両方の耳を持っている、右の狼耳が欠けており。\n紺色髪、ギザ歯、右目は赤色、左目は灰色で、左眉から目を貫いた傷があり。\n直情径行で、少々荒っぽく、喧嘩っ早い。\n悪人ツラけど弱き者いじめをすることは嫌い。\n昂ぶり状態になると、左胸に狼のタトゥーが浮かび上がる。\n彼は絶滅したと思われていた妖狼一族の生き残り、\n紺と紫の影焰を操る、または影狼を呼び出す異能がある。\nくわしいのキャラ参照は下記のURLをご覧ください。\n\n構図等様々に関してお任せ致します、お好きな描いてください！\nできれば影狼を描いてほしいが、複雑すぎる場合は省略してもOK\n細かい設定についてはお好みで調整して構いません。\n\n依頼内容になにか問題があれば再送要請してください。\nSNS、ネットで公開する時には、先生を注記してから投稿します。\n他の人に任せるときの参考として使用させていただくことがあります。\n\n私のリクエストを考慮していただければ幸いです、ありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15NdsNmKObJgDcBc8Pl1X_XDilX8O_gIM", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@iseink100/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3305073, "client_id": 1208881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19a87ad66adc3fc131b19ad56b1287da", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19a87ad66adc3fc131b19ad56b1287da, https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d3234aa107b51fa34edf4afe362ba21 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f77c4173bc05a3884a724ba1517f8c90 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ec793d0968d9eb80987af74e8a2606fe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ec793d0968d9eb80987af74e8a2606fe, https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=550f7014c4cd85bf51fc2add3f3681f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b8582c9/uploads/origins/310ce5b4-0119-469d-ba2a-79ab0d8f4f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c0987338cfaa0111576ca66a8892765 3x"}, "body": "hello! i loved the piece you did for me previously and would be so thrilled if you could draw another original character for me!\n\nappearance:\n- his right eye is considerably paler than his left eye, which is grey! \n- he has a beauty mark on the tip of his nose. \n- he also has two eyebrow piercings on the right side of his face, and a lip ring. \n- his face has a lot of scars. the scars include what look like little stitches (or \"X\"-es) at the corners of his lips.\n- his features are usually pretty hard to see clearly because his hair is so unruly haha. \n- his hair is black, messy, and covers most of his ear piercings. aside from the detailed/ornate ones he wears on his right ear, he wears two plain silver studs on his lobe on his left ear.\n- he wears sunglasses around a lot because his eyes are sensitive! \n- he is also always seen with a plain chain necklace around his neck.\n- i would love if you could add some blue forget-me-not tattoos on his arms! t\n\nprofile:\n- his age is unknown, but estimated to be about 24/25. \n- darker skin\n- 190 cm. he has an athletic build.\n- he dresses like a punk. a lot of ripped clothing, tattered/old clothes in general. his body is always too warm/hot and he works as a mechanic, so he likes to keep his clothes loose. \n- he has an easygoing/relaxed expression to his face that can come across as haughty and unapproachable sometimes, but he's actually pretty gentle-hearted. he doesn't remember any of his past, and he can't speak as a result of lingering trauma, but he tries his best to work hard and be useful!\n- because he cannot speak due to trauma, he uses his phone to type out messages for the most person. contrary to his tough appearance, he texts in a very cute way.\n- he is extremely naive because of how little he remembers of his past. in truth, he has a special ability that allows him to manipulate memories, and he inadvertently erased his own and is not aware of this. \n- he's from a world that is recovering from the apocalypse. cities have been dilapidated and torn down, and people are trying to rebuild, but it is still extremely turbulent. \n\ni have included reference images in the link, but leave all composition and other aspects up to you. the second appearance reference removes his bangs so you can see his facial features more clearly. \n\nthank you for your consideration! please feel free to turn down the request for any reason!!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/civaQk4", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@iseink100/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "